cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  api-mcp-compiler: semantic and safe compilation of enterprise APIs
  into MCP tool surfaces
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Subhadip
    family-names: Mitra
    email: contact@subhadipmitra.com
    website: https://subhadipmitra.com
repository-code: https://github.com/bassrehab/api-mcp-compiler
url: https://api-mcp.subhadipmitra.com/
abstract: >-
  A compiler that converts REST/OpenAPI and SOAP/WSDL service
  descriptions into agent-ready MCP tool surfaces. Every field carries
  provenance, judgement is proposed rather than applied, governance is
  derived separately from code generation, and write or destructive
  tools are not emitted executable until a human approves them by
  class. Comparisons between a semantically planned surface and a
  one-tool-per-operation baseline are pre-registered before they run.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - openapi
  - wsdl
  - soap
  - llm-agents
  - api-governance
  - tool-use
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
